      "title": "Tata Trusts meet 'routine', ahead of likely faceoff at Tata Sons board",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/tata-trusts-meet-routine-ahead-of-likely-faceoff-at-tata-sons-board-126112000966_1.html",
      "description": "Sir Dorabji Tata Trust approved philanthropic grants, including ₹50 crore for Jehangir Hospital, but kept Tata Sons' proposed listing and restructuring plans off its agenda.",
